#: lib/paths.ts
msgid "‘{name}’ cannot be a remote name. A name may contain letters, digits, spaces and _ - . + @, and cannot start with - or a space."
msgstr "“{name}”不能用作远程存储的名称。名称可以包含字母、数字、空格和 _ - . + @，且不能以 - 或空格开头。"

#: src/components/navigator/selection.ts
msgid "“{name}” is selected, so its contents are included already. Unselect it to choose items inside it."
msgstr "“{name}”已选中，其中的内容已包含在内。取消选中它，才能选择其中的项目。"

#: src/pages/Wizard/flow.ts
msgid "\"Just once\" means it runs when you start it, and that is all."
msgstr "“只运行一次”指在你启动时运行一次，之后不会再自动运行。"

#: src/pages/Wizard/flow.ts
msgid "\"Keep them\" leaves the source as it is. \"Take them away\" removes each file from the source once it has safely arrived."
msgstr "“保留原文件”不会改动源。“移走原文件”会在每个文件安全到达后，将其从源中移除。"

#: src/pages/Wizard/flow.ts
msgid "\"Only the files\" deletes the files inside the folder and leaves the folders. Filters set on the Delete page narrow down which files go."
msgstr "“只删除文件”会删除文件夹中的文件，保留文件夹。在“删除”页面设置的筛选条件可以缩小删除范围。"

#: src/pages/Wizard/flow.ts
msgid "\"The folder and everything in it\" deletes the folder itself with everything in it, whatever the filters. It cannot be undone."
msgstr "“文件夹及其中的全部内容”会删除文件夹本身和其中的所有内容，不受筛选条件影响。此操作无法撤销。"

#. A favorite folder on this computer. LOCAL stands where a remote would be named.
#: src/components/navigator/utils.ts
